sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: A retained canvas texture draw
    accDescr: Texture resources submit commands into retained canvas items, which are culled and ordered before backend execution.
    participant Node as Sprite2D or CanvasItem
    participant Texture as Texture resource
    participant RS as Server dispatch
    participant Cull as RendererCanvasCull
    participant VP as RendererViewport
    participant Draw as Canvas renderer
    Node->>Texture: Draw rectangle or region
    Texture->>RS: Canvas command with server texture RID
    RS->>Cull: Append command to item
    VP->>Cull: render_canvas
    Cull->>Cull: Transform, clip, sort, and select items
    Cull->>Draw: canvas_render_items
    Draw->>Draw: Batch and record RD or GL work
